& [Fold1Identity] separates root draft, canonical document, bundle payload, final bundle, golden projection, and exact baseline
  + intended-use identity includes direction and root kind
  + content equality before stable id insertion never erases intended-use identity

& [Fold2Relations] keeps graphs local
  + document points to one root fingerprint and one universe fingerprint
  + every $ref points to one member of the same document $defs
  + bundle relates five documents and two direction inventories without cross-direction definition sharing

& [Fold3Transformation] is deterministic
  + validate prerequisite pair, materialize closure, insert dialect and id, canonicalize, account, digest, package, fingerprint, and project
  + each transform is pure and the atomic public result appears only after all transforms pass

& [Fold4Boundaries] fail closed
  + reserved-key collision, wrong direction, incomplete closure, nonlocal reference, stale lineage, drift, and exhaustion are typed faults
  + no partial artifact is authorized and no runtime filesystem is touched

& [Fold5Perspectives] coordinates faculties
  + Observer accounts every root, definition, reference, byte, and artifact
  + Honesty distinguishes content identity from compatibility and signature from signer attestation
  + Security guards direction, reserved keys, closure, source lineage, and finite bounds
  + Scribe preserves canonical bytes and metadata without private schema claims
  + Refiner removes duplicated normalization and ambiguous shared-definition identity
  + Weaver joins five documents and two inventories into one bundle
  + Planner orders prerequisite validation before materialization and proof before activation

& [Fold6Proof] triangulates independent evidence
  + regeneration equals goldens byte for byte
  + rescan reconstructs closure and digests from released values
  + adversarial mutations refuse and complete workspace regressions remain green

& [Fold7Growth] permits later consumers without granting them
  + I03 may consume documents for byte parsing, duplicate rejection, validation, residuals, and conformance
  + I05 may consume exact baselines for direction-aware compatibility classification
  + no later authority is inferred from this formation or a future I02C implementation
